   "claims": [
    "Our dog pregnancy calculator is based on the fact that gestation in dogs lasts for about 63 days (approximately two months).",
    "The dog gestation calculator uses the following formula: Due date = Date of mating + 63 days If you know the mating date, your vet may perform a palpation test 28 days after breeding to confirm that your dog is pregnant.",
    "Dog due date, labor, and pregnancy Your dog can get pregnant between the ages of 2 to 6.",
    "At that time, your dog's temperature will drop by 1.8 °F.",
    "💡 The dogs' labor may last from 12 to even 60(!) hours.",
    "A dog's egg cell must mature for 2-5 days before it can be fertilized by sperm!",
    "Starting at the beginning of the second month of gestation, the pregnant dog should consume 20-25% food more than usual.",
    "At the end of pregnancy, the amount should rise to 50%.",
    "The typical dog pregnancy is approximately 2 months."
